TORCH208 [*] `torch.qr` is superseded by `torch.linalg.qr`
  --> TORCH208.py:9:1
   |
 8 | # Errors (should trigger TORCH208)
 9 | torch.qr(x)
   | ^^^^^^^^
10 | torch.cholesky(x)
11 | torch.matrix_rank(x)
   |
help: Replace `torch.qr` with `torch.linalg.qr`
6  | x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, 4.0]])
7  |
8  | # Errors (should trigger TORCH208)
   - torch.qr(x)
9  + torch.linalg.qr(x)
10 | torch.cholesky(x)
11 | torch.matrix_rank(x)
12 | torch.pinverse(x)
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

